+        all its drafts count as rejected. That is the token a non-speculative
+        step would emit, and GPU vLLM's rejection sampler is lossless, so the
+        tokens follow the GPU distribution (greedy: the same tokens); only the
+        speed-up of that request is lost. Other requests keep the device
+        result.
